*              DEFINITION HIERARCHY (LOCAL SYMBOLS, ETC.)                   0099
       SPACE   2                                                            0100
TOP    DEFINE                      .DEFINITION HEADER                       0101
X                                                                           0102
Y                                                                           0103
Z                                                                           0104
HIGH   DEFINE                      .INTERIOR DEFINITION                     0105
X              X                   . A LOCAL DEFINITION FOR X               0106
               Y                   . DEFINITION FOR Y COMES FROM ABOVE      0107
       END  .HIGH                  END OF DEFINITION 'HIGH'                 0108
HI     DEFINE                                                               0109
               X,,TOP.X            . REFERS TO TOP, NOT HIGH                0110
Y              HIGH.X              .   BUT WE CAN DO THE OTHER TOO          0111
Z                                                                           0112
MED    DEFINE  Y                   .THE HIERARCHY HERE IS . . .             0113
Z              Y                   .     TOP                                0114
LOW    DEFINE                      .      HIGH                              0115
D              X,,TOP.X            .      HI                                0116
               Y                   .       MED                              0117
               Z,,MED.Z            .        LOW                             0118
